WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.930 --> 01:31.180
[My Journey to You]

01:31.210 --> 01:34.050
[Episode 3]

01:45.710 --> 01:46.710
Miss Yun Weishan.

01:47.670 --> 01:49.330
Please turn your face around.

02:01.830 --> 02:03.290
You said it's contagious.

02:03.580 --> 02:05.060
Then why is Miss Yun Weishan

02:05.060 --> 02:06.390
staying in your room

02:06.950 --> 02:08.280
instead of her own room?

02:10.150 --> 02:12.490
Why is she in my room?

02:12.830 --> 02:13.420
Yeah.

02:13.880 --> 02:14.740
I'm asking you.

02:17.370 --> 02:18.360
You need to ask?

02:18.390 --> 02:19.320
What do you mean?

02:19.700 --> 02:23.150
Don't you know that my family has practiced medicine for generations?

02:23.150 --> 02:24.800
Our Ziyun Detoxifying Cream

02:24.930 --> 02:26.460
is always in short supply.

02:29.220 --> 02:30.220
Miss Yun Weishan.

02:30.550 --> 02:31.750
Please lift the quilt

02:32.110 --> 02:33.310
and let me take a look.

02:39.140 --> 02:40.400
How audacious you are!

02:40.750 --> 02:42.200
You broke into my bedroom

02:42.670 --> 02:44.530
and now want her to lift the quilt.

02:44.750 --> 02:46.810
Do you know who we'll be in the future?

02:46.990 --> 02:47.650
Forgive me.

03:00.430 --> 03:01.550
Are you done?

03:03.560 --> 03:07.010
We didn't marry into the Gong family to be humiliated by you guys!

03:07.010 --> 03:08.010
Just wait and see.

03:08.640 --> 03:11.840
Your limbs will be cut off and your eyes will be gouged out.

03:12.150 --> 03:13.660
Apologies for the disrespect.

03:13.660 --> 03:15.400
Please have a good rest inside.

03:16.190 --> 03:17.860
Don't go out

03:18.340 --> 03:19.600
until further notice.

03:41.860 --> 03:42.990
You're in the clear.

03:56.770 --> 03:58.970
[Council of Elders of the Gong family]

04:16.589 --> 04:17.850
Elders, good evening.

04:18.329 --> 04:19.860
In an attack from our enemy,

04:20.709 --> 04:23.510
the Sword Wielder and Young Lord Huanyu both died.

04:27.230 --> 04:29.290
According to the rules of the Gong family,

04:29.290 --> 04:31.050
the Council of Elders decided

04:31.700 --> 04:34.470
to start Absent Inheritance instantly.

04:35.270 --> 04:36.200
The successor,

04:36.580 --> 04:38.980
Gong Ziyu, the second son of the Yu Lineage,

04:39.310 --> 04:40.409
is appointed the Sword Wielder,

04:40.409 --> 04:41.810
effective immediately.

05:44.790 --> 05:45.680
Drink it.

05:46.230 --> 05:47.560
If you delay any longer,

05:48.120 --> 05:49.850
it'll leave a scar on your face.

06:11.810 --> 06:13.810
Dark is the sky. Yellow is the earth.

06:14.750 --> 06:16.880
Lurking around are devils and demons.

06:19.590 --> 06:20.700
Are you a Chi too?

06:24.170 --> 06:24.980
I'm a Mei.

06:49.040 --> 06:49.780
Ziyu.

06:51.690 --> 06:52.710
Drink it.

07:01.650 --> 07:02.530
Drunk Blood.

07:04.670 --> 07:05.660
An anesthetic.

07:36.180 --> 07:36.690
Wait.

07:47.850 --> 07:48.470
Ziyu.

07:50.380 --> 07:52.330
Maybe you don't know

07:53.610 --> 07:55.800
what it means to get this tattoo,

07:57.860 --> 07:59.780
and what you'll be faced with.

08:01.290 --> 08:02.630
Listen carefully.

08:03.940 --> 08:05.600
After the script is tattooed,

08:06.620 --> 08:09.450
you'll be bound to Jiuchen Valley for life

08:10.660 --> 08:13.360
and have to stay here until you die.

08:15.050 --> 08:16.780
You'll live for the Gong family

08:18.380 --> 08:19.910
and die for the Gong family.

08:39.230 --> 08:39.789
Dad.

08:39.830 --> 08:41.789
Let me scrub your back.

08:42.100 --> 08:42.700
Okay.

08:44.710 --> 08:45.270
Dad.

08:46.040 --> 08:47.840
Why are there words on your back?

08:48.820 --> 08:49.680
That's the duty

08:49.830 --> 08:52.960
I need to fulfill as the Sword Wielder of the Gong family.

08:53.150 --> 08:53.880
Understand?

09:27.760 --> 09:30.630
Notify every post that we have

09:32.140 --> 09:34.620
a new Sword Wielder now.

09:35.810 --> 09:37.340
Let it be known far and wide.

09:37.620 --> 09:38.220
Yes.

09:41.070 --> 09:48.310
[Memorial Tablet of Gong Hongyu, Lord of the Gong family]

09:41.070 --> 09:48.310
[Memorial Tablet of Gong Huanyu, Young Lord of the Gong family]

10:01.230 --> 10:01.990
All the legitimate heirs of the Gong family

10:01.990 --> 10:04.060
have been taking the Herb Elixir you made.

10:04.060 --> 10:05.590
They should be immune to all poisons.

10:05.590 --> 10:07.330
Why were my father and brother poisoned?

10:07.330 --> 10:08.730
What has the Zhi Lineage done?

10:08.730 --> 10:09.130
Ziyu.

10:10.110 --> 10:10.800
Stop!

10:11.260 --> 10:12.000
Yuanzhi.

10:15.040 --> 10:17.100
You can't be rude to the Sword Wielder.

10:17.100 --> 10:18.160
The Sword Wielder?

10:18.950 --> 10:19.790
Him?

10:19.860 --> 10:20.460
Yuanzhi!

10:21.310 --> 10:22.070
Ridiculous.

10:22.990 --> 10:25.790
Gong Ziyu doesn't deserve to be the Sword Wielder.

10:25.950 --> 10:27.810
The next in line for that position

10:27.810 --> 10:28.710
should be my brother,

10:28.710 --> 10:29.570
Gong Shangjue!

10:29.930 --> 10:33.060
The first Sword Wielder of the Gong family set two rules.

10:33.620 --> 10:34.220
First,

10:34.730 --> 10:36.980
the Gong family must always have a Sword Wielder.

10:36.980 --> 10:38.580
Once the Sword Wielder dies,

10:38.660 --> 10:40.710
his successor will take his place immediately.

10:40.710 --> 10:41.310
Second,

10:41.570 --> 10:44.500
if the Sword Wielder and his successor die together,

10:44.950 --> 10:47.460
Absent Inheritance will be initiated.

10:48.110 --> 10:50.310
Gong Shangjue is not in Jiuchen Valley.

10:50.420 --> 10:51.960
According to the rules,

10:52.200 --> 10:54.460
Gong Ziyu is the only one who's qualified

10:54.530 --> 10:55.860
to be the Sword Wielder.

10:56.110 --> 10:57.110
But Gong Ziyu is…

10:57.110 --> 10:57.590
Enough!

11:01.230 --> 11:02.310
Any objections

11:02.580 --> 11:05.040
shall be dealt with after Shangjue returns.

11:43.430 --> 11:47.140
♫Will I see you again?♫

11:50.110 --> 11:53.200
♫The summer we spent together is a blur now♫

11:56.770 --> 12:00.460
♫Night breezes tousled your gray hair♫

12:03.320 --> 12:06.790
♫You looked at me in silence♫

12:09.200 --> 12:11.300
♫On the porch, in the corridor♫

12:11.320 --> 12:14.770
♫Our past is whispering♫

12:16.370 --> 12:20.710
♫I stare at the moon and keep thinking about you♫

12:17.640 --> 12:18.280
Dad.

12:18.430 --> 12:20.470
Can you teach me how to write my name?

12:20.510 --> 12:20.990
Sure.

12:21.580 --> 12:22.520
Give me your hand.

12:22.520 --> 12:24.510
♫Wine in my hand♫

12:24.530 --> 12:28.190
♫The old days slip through my fingers like sand♫

12:29.730 --> 12:34.030
♫I drink to forget you but only miss you even more♫

12:36.750 --> 12:37.410
Keep going!

12:53.340 --> 12:56.710
♫Will you think of me sometimes?♫

12:58.290 --> 13:01.760
[Memorial Tablet of Yang, Beloved Wife and Mother]

13:00.080 --> 13:03.590
♫When the rain just stops and you feel lonely♫

13:03.930 --> 13:04.700
Brother.

13:06.820 --> 13:10.210
♫New lives are beginning in the distant mountains in the fog♫

13:07.550 --> 13:09.720
Will you and Dad leave me too?

13:10.850 --> 13:11.490
No.

13:13.390 --> 13:14.780
I'll always be with you.

13:13.440 --> 13:17.100
♫When tears are shed, they become flowers♫

13:19.330 --> 13:21.270
♫When you put your hands♫

13:21.380 --> 13:24.740
♫On my shoulders♫

13:26.310 --> 13:30.840
♫All my fear and hesitation were gone♫

13:32.610 --> 13:34.550
♫Snow falls♫

13:34.590 --> 13:37.890
♫My wound will never close♫

13:39.570 --> 13:43.900
♫I've been adrift for too long but now I'm home♫

13:40.100 --> 13:41.160
Young Master Ziyu.

13:45.900 --> 13:48.090
♫People come and people go♫

13:46.190 --> 13:47.410
Drunk as a skunk again.

13:47.410 --> 13:47.940
Get in.

13:48.120 --> 13:51.340
♫When I walked past you♫

13:53.060 --> 13:57.390
♫I didn't know it'd be the last time I looked around and saw you♫

13:59.270 --> 14:01.270
♫I stumble to find you♫

14:01.290 --> 14:04.800
♫I have so much to say to you♫

14:06.400 --> 14:10.770
♫Thank you, and sorry♫

14:07.220 --> 14:07.820
Go back

14:08.450 --> 14:09.850
and reflect in your room.

14:09.980 --> 14:10.590
If

14:10.830 --> 14:13.240
you keep being a useless good-for-nothing,

14:13.240 --> 14:14.950
you don't have to stay in the Gong family anymore.

14:14.950 --> 14:16.180
It's not like I want to stay here!

14:16.180 --> 14:16.530
You…

14:16.900 --> 14:20.500
♫Yesterday fades like a distant mountain♫

14:17.230 --> 14:18.690
Ziyu, where are you going?

14:19.400 --> 14:20.790
Don't stop him. Let him go!

14:20.790 --> 14:22.210
He'd better get as far away as he can

14:22.210 --> 14:23.340
and never come back!

14:23.450 --> 14:25.910
♫Tears are the snow♫

14:27.250 --> 14:28.780
♫On the top of the mountain♫

14:39.670 --> 14:41.120
[Feng]

14:43.190 --> 14:45.340
The Sword Wielder of the Gong family was killed?

14:45.340 --> 14:46.580
Are you sure?

14:47.640 --> 14:48.590
Yes.

14:49.210 --> 14:50.270
I've confirmed it.

14:50.600 --> 14:51.840
Our assassins did it?

14:52.010 --> 14:52.740
I'm not sure.

14:53.420 --> 14:54.060
But

14:54.460 --> 14:56.590
I don't think the assassins we sent out

14:57.120 --> 14:57.850
are capable enough

14:57.850 --> 14:59.850
to take him down in such a short time.

15:02.200 --> 15:02.730
Besides,

15:03.270 --> 15:04.600
the mission we gave them

15:05.490 --> 15:07.290
is not to kill the Sword Wielder.

15:07.810 --> 15:09.460
Maybe they got exposed

15:09.490 --> 15:11.290
and had no choice but to kill him.

15:11.470 --> 15:12.270
I got word

15:12.690 --> 15:14.640
that Miss Zheng Nanyi's cover was blown.

15:14.640 --> 15:16.850
Gong Shangjue is headed to the Zheng family of Hunyuan

15:16.850 --> 15:17.710
to look into it.

15:18.760 --> 15:20.160
Have you taken care of it?

15:20.410 --> 15:21.440
Rest assured.

15:22.440 --> 15:23.370
It's all done.

15:24.620 --> 15:25.480
No trace

15:26.090 --> 15:26.950
is left behind.

15:28.430 --> 15:29.820
Good.

15:30.110 --> 15:31.280
The remaining Chis and Meis

15:31.280 --> 15:33.740
must've made it into the Gong family.

15:35.070 --> 15:38.000
Let's look forward to their performance.

15:44.170 --> 15:46.130
[Zheng Family of Hunyuan]

15:47.910 --> 15:48.850
Young Master Shangjue.

15:48.850 --> 15:50.450
The entire mansion is empty.

15:50.600 --> 15:52.130
All the valuables are gone.

16:15.420 --> 16:16.880
Did you stay here all night

16:17.890 --> 16:19.490
or come early in the morning?

16:22.570 --> 16:24.500
You're already the Sword Wielder.

16:25.560 --> 16:27.690
There are a lot of things you need to do.

16:29.870 --> 16:31.150
You can't fall apart.

16:33.640 --> 16:35.770
I never wanted to be the Sword Wielder.

16:37.430 --> 16:38.490
-But...
-But...

16:47.590 --> 16:49.790
Now that I'm already the Sword Wielder,

16:51.110 --> 16:53.000
I can do whatever I want.

16:54.300 --> 16:55.300
No one can stop me.

16:57.790 --> 16:59.120
What are you going to do?

17:02.590 --> 17:03.490
Who found

17:04.140 --> 17:05.940
my father and brother's bodies?

17:07.089 --> 17:08.089
Lady Wuji.

17:12.380 --> 17:12.910
Let's go.

17:13.290 --> 17:14.290
I need to meet her.

17:23.310 --> 17:24.440
Your father asked me

17:25.329 --> 17:26.780
to give this to you.

17:29.750 --> 17:32.330
Last month, he got a fine red fox pelt

17:33.400 --> 17:35.200
and made a robe for your brother.

17:36.620 --> 17:37.950
Then he used the remnant

17:38.810 --> 17:40.340
to make this for you.

17:46.610 --> 17:49.130
He said you like these exquisite things.

17:51.240 --> 17:53.300
He was too shy to give it to you himself

17:53.390 --> 17:54.590
so he asked me to do it.

18:02.050 --> 18:04.450
Your father's bark was worse than his bite.

18:06.030 --> 18:06.750
Actually,

18:08.390 --> 18:10.250
he regretted being so harsh to you

18:11.690 --> 18:13.420
because of the female assassin

18:14.250 --> 18:16.710
but was too embarrassed to apologize to you.

18:19.020 --> 18:19.950
Don't blame him.

18:21.510 --> 18:22.110
Lady Wuji.

18:27.030 --> 18:28.180
Can you tell me

18:30.470 --> 18:32.580
what happened that night?

18:35.910 --> 18:36.700
That night,

18:38.750 --> 18:40.410
I was in your father's study

18:41.700 --> 18:42.830
brewing tea for him.

18:44.340 --> 18:45.340
Young Lord Huanyu

18:45.650 --> 18:47.580
suddenly came in with a woman

18:47.950 --> 18:49.210
whose hands were tied.

18:49.780 --> 18:51.220
I got up and left.

18:58.370 --> 18:59.500
I went to the kitchen

18:59.980 --> 19:01.340
to make supper for them.

19:02.070 --> 19:03.330
After it was finished,

19:03.750 --> 19:05.390
I returned to the yard

19:06.230 --> 19:08.010
and heard a fierce fight.

19:09.340 --> 19:10.470
Through the window,

19:11.130 --> 19:13.530
I saw three people fighting.

19:14.560 --> 19:16.320
After a few loud thuds,

19:16.750 --> 19:18.150
the room went dark.

19:19.030 --> 19:19.700
Then

19:20.130 --> 19:21.170
it became quiet.

19:22.190 --> 19:22.790
Lady Wuji.

19:23.620 --> 19:24.970
Why didn't you call the guards?

19:24.970 --> 19:25.660
I did.

19:26.700 --> 19:27.800
But at that time,

19:28.380 --> 19:30.440
there was no guard on duty in the yard.

19:30.930 --> 19:31.930
That was strange.

19:32.820 --> 19:35.840
The guardians should always be around to protect the Sword Wielder.

19:35.840 --> 19:37.330
Seeing the candles go out

19:39.010 --> 19:41.010
and the room plunged into darkness,

19:41.880 --> 19:43.340
I rushed over immediately

19:43.660 --> 19:45.460
and opened the door of the study.

19:48.310 --> 19:49.770
I found the Sword Wielder,

19:50.580 --> 19:51.350
Huanyu,

19:53.130 --> 19:55.260
and that woman lying dead on the floor.

20:03.550 --> 20:05.350
I met that female assassin once.

20:06.760 --> 20:08.890
She wasn't good enough at martial arts

20:09.090 --> 20:11.900
to kill both my father and brother.

20:12.960 --> 20:14.020
I don't believe it.

20:14.130 --> 20:15.790
But she used poison.

20:18.260 --> 20:20.030
Maybe she managed it

20:20.870 --> 20:22.400
by catching them unawares.

20:35.870 --> 20:37.330
Lady Wuji, we shall leave.

20:39.700 --> 20:40.160
Let's go

20:40.870 --> 20:42.330
meet those two guardians.

20:51.870 --> 20:53.870
That night, the Sword Wielder met Young Master Shangjue first.

20:53.870 --> 20:55.390
Then Young Lord Huanyu suddenly came

20:55.390 --> 20:56.910
and asked to see the Sword Wielder.

20:56.910 --> 20:59.080
After the three of them talked for a while,

20:59.080 --> 21:00.790
Young Master Shangjue left in a hurry.

21:00.790 --> 21:02.990
Young Master Shangjue left Jiuchen Valley in the night.

21:02.990 --> 21:04.520
The wedding is coming soon.

21:05.030 --> 21:06.230
Why is he leaving?

21:06.910 --> 21:07.790
Who do you mean?

21:08.430 --> 21:09.710
Young Master Shangjue.

21:09.710 --> 21:12.700
Young Lord Huanyu went to the prison to interrogate the female assassin

21:12.700 --> 21:14.310
and brought her to the Sword Wielder.

21:14.310 --> 21:17.110
He ordered me and the Green Jade Guardian to leave.

21:17.230 --> 21:20.390
Young Lord Huanyu said he needed to discuss something important with the Sword Wielder

21:20.390 --> 21:22.120
and asked me and Jin Yu to leave.

21:26.210 --> 21:28.060
Do you think they were lying?

21:28.710 --> 21:30.970
Then let's meet someone who doesn't lie.

21:32.890 --> 21:34.540
The dead don't lie.

21:43.500 --> 21:44.310
Be careful.

21:45.220 --> 21:46.880
The hairpin may be poisonous.

21:47.710 --> 21:48.910
Something was wrong

21:48.910 --> 21:51.370
with the Herb Elixir your father and brother took.

21:51.370 --> 21:53.970
The Herb Elixir you take may not be safe either.

22:12.480 --> 22:14.910
The gem on the hairpin is hollow.

22:16.220 --> 22:17.070
The poison

22:17.690 --> 22:19.040
was hidden in the gem.

22:25.320 --> 22:27.920
The fingers of Father's right hand are purple.

22:28.870 --> 22:30.840
It's obviously caused by poison.

22:33.070 --> 22:33.760
But

22:34.520 --> 22:36.120
how did my father and brother

22:36.270 --> 22:38.200
come into contact with the poison?

22:38.550 --> 22:41.970
Maybe something was hidden in the secret groove of the hairpin

22:41.970 --> 22:43.540
and taken out by them.

22:44.980 --> 22:46.890
Perhaps, during that process,

22:47.290 --> 22:49.490
they were exposed to the deadly poison.

22:50.150 --> 22:51.010
Secret groove?

22:52.150 --> 22:53.680
Did you find anything in it?

22:54.420 --> 22:55.950
It was empty when I found it.

22:57.130 --> 22:57.870
Maybe

22:58.940 --> 23:01.940
Young Master Shangjue took away whatever was inside.

23:11.150 --> 23:12.310
There is a burn on the female assassin's skin

23:12.310 --> 23:13.710
which was left by poison.

23:13.820 --> 23:15.480
But it didn't cause her death.

23:21.200 --> 23:23.030
The cut that pierced through her chest

23:23.030 --> 23:24.050
killed her.

23:25.660 --> 23:27.750
How did she get on the bride list?

23:28.540 --> 23:30.370
She was the second daughter of the Zheng family of Hunyuan,

23:30.370 --> 23:31.180
Zheng Nanyi.

23:32.580 --> 23:34.760
But we don't know if that identity

23:35.470 --> 23:36.590
is true.

23:38.990 --> 23:40.420
After the accident happened,

23:40.420 --> 23:42.050
did you check the Ladies' Hostel?

23:42.050 --> 23:44.090
I sent guards over in time.

23:44.390 --> 23:45.990
All of them were in the house.

23:46.150 --> 23:47.550
None of them had gone out.

23:47.710 --> 23:48.370
But

23:49.300 --> 23:50.760
two brides were poisoned.

23:52.510 --> 23:53.240
Who are they?

23:53.410 --> 23:54.320
They're the two brides

23:54.320 --> 23:55.890
who got the golden tokens.

23:56.910 --> 23:58.440
Jiang Lili and Yun Weishan.

24:03.990 --> 24:04.520
Let's go.

24:11.760 --> 24:13.580
[Feng]

24:55.950 --> 24:58.210
What brought you here at this early hour?

25:07.320 --> 25:08.380
You think too much.

25:17.370 --> 25:18.190
How can I help?

25:19.130 --> 25:20.620
Since we're the same,

25:21.190 --> 25:21.860
I think

25:22.880 --> 25:25.100
I should be clear with you.

25:25.550 --> 25:27.270
Wait. We're not the same.

25:28.230 --> 25:29.660
I told you yesterday.

25:30.010 --> 25:32.240
I'm a Mei. I'm superior to you.

25:33.190 --> 25:36.560
In Wufeng, you must listen to your superiors.

25:37.070 --> 25:38.210
You must know that.

25:38.800 --> 25:39.450
I do.

25:40.860 --> 25:42.260
I just didn't expect them

25:42.710 --> 25:43.990
to plant a Mei

25:43.990 --> 25:45.600
in the Gong family too.

25:46.270 --> 25:48.000
Everything comes with a price.

25:48.470 --> 25:50.700
With prices come sacrifices.

25:52.020 --> 25:53.960
If Miss Zheng hadn't been exposed,

25:54.910 --> 25:56.310
you would've been the one

25:57.070 --> 25:58.200
who was sacrificed.

26:03.840 --> 26:04.770
Was she a Mei too?

26:05.620 --> 26:06.620
She was too stupid

26:07.300 --> 26:08.270
to be a Mei.

26:10.350 --> 26:11.280
So in the future,

26:12.070 --> 26:12.870
the two of us

26:12.870 --> 26:14.930
will carry out the mission together?

26:15.270 --> 26:16.870
Is there anyone else with us?

26:17.730 --> 26:19.060
Crows gather together.

26:19.860 --> 26:21.390
The eagle flies high alone.

26:22.440 --> 26:23.440
There is

26:24.630 --> 26:25.690
no "us".

26:27.320 --> 26:29.250
And we won't do anything together.

26:31.470 --> 26:32.180
I see.

26:36.290 --> 26:36.850
Wait.

26:39.110 --> 26:41.040
You went out by stealth last night.

26:41.140 --> 26:42.470
What did you find?

26:44.150 --> 26:45.480
I saved you.

26:46.230 --> 26:47.830
The least you can do is tell me

26:48.430 --> 26:49.520
who's dead.

26:51.910 --> 26:53.570
How did you know someone died?

26:54.950 --> 26:57.350
There are so many white lanterns in the air.

26:57.550 --> 27:00.940
And the servants have been bustling around with candles and funeral items.

27:00.940 --> 27:01.740
I'm not blind.

27:02.230 --> 27:03.300
I can guess.

27:05.670 --> 27:07.440
The Sword Wielder and Young Lord Huanyu

27:07.440 --> 27:08.790
both died.

27:13.900 --> 27:15.100
You killed them?

27:34.270 --> 27:34.930
Physician,

27:38.590 --> 27:40.510
what's the poison that's making her sick?

27:40.510 --> 27:41.570
It's complicated.

27:41.750 --> 27:44.280
There seems to be more than one kind of poison.

27:54.720 --> 27:55.380
Physician,

27:56.070 --> 27:57.440
is the rash on her face

27:57.530 --> 27:58.920
caused by poison too?

27:59.340 --> 27:59.710
Yes.

28:00.190 --> 28:01.720
It's a kind of strong poison

28:01.770 --> 28:03.370
that takes effect very fast.

28:03.630 --> 28:05.240
Miss Jiang is unconscious

28:05.380 --> 28:06.700
and keeps slurring.

28:07.230 --> 28:08.260
She might have been affected

28:08.260 --> 28:10.210
by a poison that targets her mind.

28:11.700 --> 28:12.900
Is her life in danger?

28:13.800 --> 28:14.930
I'm not sure of that.

28:15.300 --> 28:16.830
The rash on her face will heal

28:16.830 --> 28:19.360
after she takes some detoxifying decoction.

28:19.950 --> 28:20.880
But as to the poison

28:20.880 --> 28:22.700
that makes her delirious,

28:22.990 --> 28:24.190
I haven't figured out

28:24.380 --> 28:25.780
how to neutralize it yet.

28:26.260 --> 28:28.790
I have to consult Young Master Yuanzhi later.

28:31.150 --> 28:32.990
Physician, the decoction is ready.

28:32.990 --> 28:33.720
Send it over.

28:34.000 --> 28:34.460
Yes.

28:34.950 --> 28:35.610
Physician.

28:35.850 --> 28:36.780
That decoction…

28:36.820 --> 28:37.220
Well,

28:37.630 --> 28:38.790
it's for Miss Yun Weishan,

28:38.790 --> 28:41.030
the girl who also got a golden token.

28:41.430 --> 28:43.550
She has the same rash on her face too.

28:46.490 --> 28:48.020
I didn't kill them.

28:51.390 --> 28:53.790
My mission is not to kill the Sword Wielder.

28:53.810 --> 28:55.270
Then what's your mission?

28:57.280 --> 28:58.670
I don't think

28:59.820 --> 29:01.410
we can talk about that.

29:02.570 --> 29:03.770
We can't.

29:04.580 --> 29:06.010
But I just want to help.

29:06.640 --> 29:07.850
If you act recklessly again

29:07.850 --> 29:09.960
like you did yesterday,

29:10.740 --> 29:11.620
I'll have to

29:12.210 --> 29:14.190
clean up the mess for you.

29:14.910 --> 29:16.750
If I know what your mission is,

29:17.230 --> 29:19.540
I may be able to cover for you.

29:21.590 --> 29:22.470
After all,

29:23.190 --> 29:24.440
if you're exposed,

29:25.980 --> 29:27.320
Miss Zheng Nanyi

29:27.910 --> 29:29.440
would've died for nothing.

29:35.920 --> 29:36.610
Weishan,

29:37.430 --> 29:38.750
I mean no harm.

29:39.180 --> 29:40.310
Don't overthink it.

29:44.890 --> 29:46.340
Do you mind me calling you

29:46.860 --> 29:47.610
Weishan?

29:49.190 --> 29:51.520
You don't feel sorry for Miss Zheng at all.

29:52.340 --> 29:54.070
You're just worried that if I'm exposed,

29:54.070 --> 29:55.800
you can't stay hidden anymore.

29:57.600 --> 29:59.200
The Gong family will realize

29:59.510 --> 30:01.370
that there may be other assassins

30:01.370 --> 30:02.720
besides me.

30:04.230 --> 30:04.830
Am I right?

30:07.880 --> 30:08.500
Look.

30:09.600 --> 30:10.820
There is

30:11.990 --> 30:13.130
an "us".

30:17.430 --> 30:18.260
So,

30:20.920 --> 30:22.450
we'd better work together.

30:23.430 --> 30:24.580
I told you.

30:25.310 --> 30:27.010
Our missions are different.

30:28.210 --> 30:30.400
You poisoned Miss Jiang's tea.

30:31.500 --> 30:32.830
You want to replace her.

30:33.720 --> 30:35.610
Our missions should be the same.

30:36.610 --> 30:38.870
Didn't Miss Jiang get the rash on her face

30:40.240 --> 30:42.800
from your nail polish?

30:43.980 --> 30:44.870
You saw it?

30:45.310 --> 30:46.370
I don't need to.

30:46.620 --> 30:48.880
Isn't that the basic training in Wufeng?

30:49.160 --> 30:51.200
I could've made Miss Jiang a lunatic

30:51.230 --> 30:53.770
without arousing any suspicion.

30:54.620 --> 30:56.250
But you suddenly showed up.

30:58.470 --> 31:00.070
If I'm right,

31:01.330 --> 31:02.440
before long,

31:03.020 --> 31:05.080
I'll have to clean up your mess again.

31:09.510 --> 31:10.170
Physician,

31:11.090 --> 31:12.840
is the poison the two girls suffer from

31:12.840 --> 31:14.110
related to the poison

31:14.440 --> 31:16.170
that killed the Sword Wielder?

31:16.580 --> 31:17.320
No.

31:20.410 --> 31:21.670
Thank you, Physician.

31:30.780 --> 31:32.470
Since the poison making Miss Jiang sick

31:32.470 --> 31:35.170
is not the one that killed your father and brother,

31:35.170 --> 31:37.370
shall we still go to the Ladies' Hostel?

31:38.510 --> 31:40.220
You're already the Sword Wielder

31:40.220 --> 31:41.600
and haven't chosen your bride yet.

31:41.600 --> 31:42.730
It's inappropriate

31:42.990 --> 31:44.050
for you to go there.

31:44.380 --> 31:46.040
A clean hand wants no washing.

31:46.220 --> 31:47.230
My hands are very clean.

31:47.230 --> 31:48.230
There's nothing to be afraid of.

31:48.230 --> 31:48.890
You always…

32:01.470 --> 32:02.960
The tea I gave Miss Jiang

32:02.980 --> 32:03.980
was not poisoned.

32:06.310 --> 32:07.280
Then it was the incense.

32:07.280 --> 32:09.410
The incense was not poisonous either.

32:10.150 --> 32:13.450
But inhaling the incense after drinking the tea

32:14.270 --> 32:15.250
changed things.

32:17.000 --> 32:19.860
At first, she'd just be delirious.

32:20.850 --> 32:23.770
A few days later, she'd start to mumble to herself

32:24.780 --> 32:26.040
as if she had dementia.

32:30.920 --> 32:32.710
As an assassin of Wufeng,

32:33.830 --> 32:35.190
you shouldn't

32:35.820 --> 32:37.820
have that look on your face.

32:39.670 --> 32:41.070
You're so soft-hearted.

32:41.810 --> 32:44.070
It'll cost you your life sooner or later.

32:47.070 --> 32:48.730
I don't hurt innocent people.

32:51.650 --> 32:53.510
You're so interesting, Weishan.

32:54.750 --> 32:56.680
Back to my incense and tea.

32:57.770 --> 33:00.940
Both of them are harmless when examined separately.

33:01.890 --> 33:03.490
Even if they get suspicious,

33:04.090 --> 33:05.550
they can't find anything.

33:06.230 --> 33:07.430
I kindly reminded you

33:07.460 --> 33:08.500
that tea

33:08.520 --> 33:09.670
had been tampered with

33:09.670 --> 33:11.070
and you should not drink it,

33:11.070 --> 33:13.870
but you tried to be clever and ruined everything.

33:14.350 --> 33:15.240
Thanks to you,

33:15.820 --> 33:17.680
both the rash on Miss Jiang's face

33:17.950 --> 33:19.630
and your nail polish

33:20.400 --> 33:22.000
have become solid evidence.

33:23.860 --> 33:25.210
If I were you,

33:26.380 --> 33:28.920
I'd wash it off now.

33:42.530 --> 33:44.530
Young Master Yuanzhi, you came to the clinic too.

33:44.530 --> 33:45.700
What are you here for?

33:45.700 --> 33:46.560
Sword Wielder.

33:53.310 --> 33:54.570
Young Master Yuanzhi.

33:54.670 --> 33:56.000
According to the rules,

33:56.150 --> 33:57.270
you should greet

33:57.460 --> 33:58.520
the Sword Wielder.

33:59.190 --> 33:59.850
Who are you?

34:02.120 --> 34:03.780
How dare you tell me what to do?

34:06.470 --> 34:07.010
Jin Fan.

34:08.540 --> 34:11.070
He must have a good reason for not greeting me.

34:11.929 --> 34:13.360
Although I don't understand,

34:13.360 --> 34:14.370
I won't force him.

34:15.900 --> 34:18.159
The Council of Elders will deal with him.

34:23.389 --> 34:24.250
Sword Wielder.

34:26.429 --> 34:27.830
No need for formalities.

34:29.460 --> 34:32.120
You specialize in making poisons and antidotes

34:32.989 --> 34:35.790
and performed autopsies on my father and brother.

34:36.290 --> 34:37.550
Did you find anything?

34:38.850 --> 34:40.389
They were killed by Ascension,

34:40.389 --> 34:42.449
a poison invented by the Gong family.

34:43.170 --> 34:45.920
That poison takes effect very quickly. Without timely detox,

34:45.920 --> 34:46.920
death is certain.

34:47.820 --> 34:49.340
So you mean

34:49.929 --> 34:51.250
it can be neutralized.

34:52.270 --> 34:52.610
Yes.

34:53.370 --> 34:54.170
But very hard.

34:54.790 --> 34:55.120
Is it?

34:55.750 --> 34:57.550
Since it was invented,

34:57.580 --> 35:00.380
no one taking it has ever been brought back to life.

35:00.820 --> 35:02.790
Ascension is deadly and spreads all over

35:02.790 --> 35:04.790
the victim's body via bloodstream.

35:04.990 --> 35:07.620
The window for detox is very short.

35:09.970 --> 35:10.770
How short?

35:13.860 --> 35:15.190
Within 200 heartbeats.

35:18.150 --> 35:19.680
Is it difficult

35:20.940 --> 35:22.670
to obtain such a lethal poison?

35:22.710 --> 35:23.930
Seems that you're

35:23.960 --> 35:26.550
not very familiar with the Gong family's business.

35:26.550 --> 35:27.350
Ascension

35:27.350 --> 35:29.530
is sold at every post of the Gong family

35:29.590 --> 35:30.950
in and out of Jiuchen Valley.

35:30.950 --> 35:32.130
Anyone can buy it.

35:33.000 --> 35:34.470
So you mean

35:35.380 --> 35:36.980
the poison called Ascension

35:37.560 --> 35:39.220
is hard to cure but easy to get.

35:39.830 --> 35:41.090
Young Master Yuanzhi.

35:41.270 --> 35:42.470
Are there precautions

35:42.470 --> 35:43.270
one can take?

35:51.210 --> 35:53.070
I don't understand what you mean.

35:54.550 --> 35:55.950
Let me put it another way.

35:56.630 --> 35:59.100
Will someone who takes the Herb Elixir every day

35:59.100 --> 36:00.330
be affected by it?

36:07.310 --> 36:07.830
No.

36:07.830 --> 36:08.790
My father and brother

36:08.790 --> 36:10.350
took the Herb Elixir every day

36:10.350 --> 36:11.410
but were poisoned.

36:12.190 --> 36:13.520
Does that mean I can hold

36:14.140 --> 36:16.600
those who make the Herb Elixir accountable?

36:19.420 --> 36:21.550
Everyone in the Gong family, from elders to madams,

36:21.550 --> 36:24.070
has been taking the Herb Elixir and other tonics

36:24.070 --> 36:25.590
made by the Zhi Lineage for many years.

36:25.590 --> 36:27.190
Nothing had ever gone wrong.

36:27.990 --> 36:29.990
You asked me why I came to the clinic.

36:30.470 --> 36:31.790
I came to check

36:31.790 --> 36:33.050
if there is any problem

36:33.150 --> 36:34.530
with the Herb Elixir here.

36:34.530 --> 36:35.840
Is there?

36:39.570 --> 36:40.420
No.

36:40.830 --> 36:42.760
We're right back where we started.

36:43.350 --> 36:44.500
Why on earth

36:45.380 --> 36:47.440
were my father and brother poisoned?

36:48.410 --> 36:50.610
I'm in charge of making the Herb Elixir,

36:51.220 --> 36:53.280
but after sending it to different lineages,

36:53.280 --> 36:55.480
it's served by the servants of your own.

36:56.430 --> 36:57.480
Why don't you

36:57.600 --> 36:59.860
look into the servants of the Yu Lineage?

37:00.770 --> 37:02.300
Maybe you'll be surprised.

37:09.970 --> 37:11.300
Of course I'll look into

37:12.420 --> 37:14.150
the servants of the Yu Lineage.

37:14.750 --> 37:16.150
You should do that.

37:18.630 --> 37:19.350
Besides,

37:19.770 --> 37:22.100
you were just appointed the Sword Wielder

37:22.740 --> 37:26.000
and made ungrounded accusations against the Zhi Lineage.

37:26.870 --> 37:27.800
How impressive.

37:31.010 --> 37:32.340
I'll find the evidence.

37:34.060 --> 37:34.870
Wait and see.

37:43.370 --> 37:45.120
The Sword Wielder and Young Lord Huanyu

37:45.120 --> 37:46.080
both died,

37:46.850 --> 37:47.610
so

37:48.280 --> 37:50.880
Absent Inheritance must have been initiated.

37:52.310 --> 37:53.510
Absent Inheritance?

37:56.100 --> 37:57.100
Didn't your Raven

37:57.300 --> 37:59.140
tell you about that?

38:01.970 --> 38:03.060
I'm just a Chi.

38:04.450 --> 38:05.780
Don't overestimate me.

38:08.360 --> 38:09.760
Your sudden humbleness

38:10.550 --> 38:11.990
took me by surprise.

38:16.680 --> 38:17.810
Absent Inheritance

38:17.910 --> 38:20.140
is a rule of the Gong family

38:20.180 --> 38:21.840
set to tide it through crises.

38:22.920 --> 38:23.980
Basically,

38:24.670 --> 38:27.250
it makes sure that the Gong family and Jiuchen Valley

38:27.250 --> 38:29.000
always have a leader.

38:29.910 --> 38:32.570
If the Sword Wielder and the Young Lord both die,

38:32.990 --> 38:34.510
the next in line of succession

38:34.510 --> 38:36.470
in Jiuchen Valley

38:36.490 --> 38:39.420
will become the new Sword Wielder unconditionally.

38:42.000 --> 38:42.710
So

38:43.130 --> 38:44.750
the Sword Wielder now

38:45.540 --> 38:47.400
should be Young Master Shangjue,

38:47.630 --> 38:48.580
Gong Shangjue.

38:50.570 --> 38:52.030
The current Sword Wielder

38:52.990 --> 38:55.450
is the younger brother of Young Lord Huanyu,

38:55.940 --> 38:56.980
Gong Ziyu.

39:03.410 --> 39:05.740
Gong Shangjue left the Valley last night.

39:06.470 --> 39:07.710
He's not here.

39:08.550 --> 39:10.750
So according to the line of succession,

39:10.940 --> 39:13.670
Gong Ziyu took the position of the Sword Wielder.

39:16.310 --> 39:17.040
Sure enough.

39:17.930 --> 39:20.130
That's what Absent Inheritance means.

39:20.350 --> 39:22.810
The Gong family is a bunch of stubborn fools.

39:23.020 --> 39:24.220
Pedantic and absurd.

39:27.670 --> 39:28.430
Now that

39:28.950 --> 39:31.350
Gong Ziyu has become the new Sword Wielder,

39:31.610 --> 39:33.230
he'll choose a new bride.

39:34.530 --> 39:35.350
It seems

39:36.330 --> 39:37.990
that he's your new target now.

39:39.510 --> 39:40.970
After losing Gong Huanyu,

39:41.790 --> 39:43.530
you can't lose Gong Ziyu too.

39:46.120 --> 39:47.280
I wish you good luck.

39:48.680 --> 39:49.540
What about you?

39:50.600 --> 39:52.000
Don't you need good luck?

39:53.580 --> 39:55.780
Miss Jiang won't recover any time soon.

39:56.830 --> 39:57.870
Don't you need

39:57.870 --> 39:59.510
to get a golden token?

40:00.430 --> 40:01.660
Why do I need that?

40:02.800 --> 40:03.930
With a golden token,

40:04.350 --> 40:06.630
whether Gong Ziyu chooses you or me,

40:08.370 --> 40:10.290
our missions will be easier.

40:12.420 --> 40:14.350
I don't need Gong Ziyu to choose me.

40:15.740 --> 40:16.550
Besides,

40:17.780 --> 40:19.910
do you think I didn't get a golden token

40:20.280 --> 40:21.410
because I couldn't?

40:24.100 --> 40:27.430
Girls, you all need to take a bath tonight.

40:27.820 --> 40:29.080
Get up early tomorrow.

40:29.630 --> 40:31.070
Don't put on any makeup.

40:31.310 --> 40:32.440
Don't wear perfume.

40:32.750 --> 40:35.520
Be your true selves

40:35.870 --> 40:37.340
and wait to be summoned.

41:04.310 --> 41:04.970
Physician.

41:05.390 --> 41:06.720
Unpleasant body smell.

41:06.750 --> 41:08.010
Low body temperature.

41:08.140 --> 41:09.190
Heavy dampness.

41:43.850 --> 41:45.980
You gave up the golden token yourself?

41:48.180 --> 41:49.380
What else could it be?

41:50.070 --> 41:52.130
Your target is not the Sword Wielder.

41:55.890 --> 41:56.890
My target

41:57.970 --> 42:00.230
is much trickier than the Sword Wielder.

42:27.500 --> 42:28.350
The Zheng family of Hunyuan

42:28.350 --> 42:29.540
has moved away.

42:30.500 --> 42:32.650
Someone must've tipped them off.

42:33.310 --> 42:33.870
Besides,

42:34.240 --> 42:36.430
the matter Young Lord Huanyu asked me to investigate

42:36.430 --> 42:38.080
has not been leaked yet.

42:50.820 --> 42:51.700
Send it back

42:51.910 --> 42:53.190
to the Gong Residence as soon as possible.

42:53.190 --> 42:53.560
Yes.

42:54.350 --> 42:54.750
Hurry.

43:00.670 --> 43:02.930
Urgent message from the Gong Residence.

43:14.870 --> 43:16.200
Young Master Shangjue.

43:16.470 --> 43:16.930
Read it.

43:19.300 --> 43:19.780
Read it.

43:20.930 --> 43:21.540
Yes.

43:25.750 --> 43:28.220
Destiny can't be refused.

43:29.770 --> 43:32.410
The lineages need a head.

43:33.470 --> 43:34.730
The Council appointed

43:35.330 --> 43:35.880
Gong...

43:37.610 --> 43:38.410
Gong Ziyu

43:39.590 --> 43:40.990
as the new Sword Wielder.

43:50.200 --> 43:52.190
When Gong Huanyu was made the heir,

43:52.550 --> 43:53.550
I thought

43:54.340 --> 43:55.200
it was so unfair

43:55.510 --> 43:56.770
and still think so now.

43:57.630 --> 43:58.530
In my mind,

43:59.550 --> 44:00.350
you're the one

44:00.500 --> 44:03.170
who should be the Sword Wielder.

44:05.050 --> 44:07.750
Instead of what happened to the Gong family

44:09.110 --> 44:10.770
and how the late Sword Wielder

44:11.270 --> 44:12.480
died,

44:13.190 --> 44:14.520
you're concerned about

44:15.140 --> 44:16.740
who is the new Sword Wielder.

44:22.490 --> 44:23.700
In the future,

44:25.400 --> 44:27.540
don't say anything like that again.

44:28.750 --> 44:29.200
Sorry.

44:33.750 --> 44:35.120
My horse has run for days

44:35.780 --> 44:36.780
and is exhausted.

44:37.800 --> 44:39.530
Find me the fastest horse here.

44:40.100 --> 44:40.500
Yes.

45:11.660 --> 45:13.300
You can see through people.

45:14.400 --> 45:16.660
You're even more capable than I thought.

45:17.150 --> 45:18.120
You flatter me.

45:18.800 --> 45:20.260
I'm a Mei after all.

45:22.720 --> 45:23.650
Well,

45:24.070 --> 45:26.270
you're much smarter than I thought too.

45:27.410 --> 45:30.840
I thought you were stupid to carry out an assassination

45:31.590 --> 45:33.810
on the first night you arrived

45:34.070 --> 45:35.330
at the Gong Residence.

45:36.060 --> 45:37.660
But now that I think about it,

45:37.910 --> 45:39.350
you didn't act on a whim.

45:40.480 --> 45:41.410
When Gong Ziyu

45:41.440 --> 45:43.040
brought us out of the prison,

45:43.790 --> 45:45.330
you memorized the night patrol routes

45:45.330 --> 45:47.330
of the guards in the Gong Residence.

45:48.750 --> 45:50.100
The night before the wedding,

45:50.100 --> 45:51.900
all the ladies went to bed early.

45:52.510 --> 45:54.050
No one would disturb them.

45:54.870 --> 45:57.400
It was the perfect time for an assassination.

45:58.420 --> 46:00.680
If the Sword Wielder hadn't been killed,

46:00.690 --> 46:02.690
you wouldn't have been discovered.

46:04.820 --> 46:05.460
Besides,

46:06.400 --> 46:09.460
you deliberately ran away from other brides that night

46:09.800 --> 46:12.330
to attract the attention of Gong Ziyu, right?

46:14.870 --> 46:17.410
When he came to the prison for the first time,

46:18.110 --> 46:19.370
all he could see was me.

46:21.300 --> 46:22.630
You pretended to escape

46:22.990 --> 46:24.450
to let him chase after you.

46:24.790 --> 46:25.320
Then,

46:25.340 --> 46:27.700
you deliberately took his precious mask

46:27.960 --> 46:29.560
to make him come to you again.

46:30.830 --> 46:31.870
You're amazing.

46:34.030 --> 46:36.430
I'm not as calculating as you think.

46:37.510 --> 46:39.910
You think too highly of me, Miss Shangguan.

46:40.670 --> 46:41.510
I just don't want

46:41.510 --> 46:43.570
to meet my Raven empty-handed

46:44.480 --> 46:46.680
half a month later.

46:55.610 --> 46:56.650
No one wants that.

47:00.640 --> 47:02.000
No one dares.

47:07.630 --> 47:08.630
Drink this

47:10.220 --> 47:12.040
and you'll be a Chi.

47:35.400 --> 47:36.060
Don't chew.

47:38.820 --> 47:39.850
Swallow them.

47:49.030 --> 47:49.940
What are they?

47:51.340 --> 47:52.010
Eggs.

47:56.720 --> 47:58.320
Eggs of Bone-Gnawing Flies.

47:59.360 --> 48:01.490
They're also called Fortnight Flies.

48:02.090 --> 48:03.370
The poison made of them

48:03.900 --> 48:05.100
is called Death Oath.

48:06.680 --> 48:09.140
It means to be loyal to Wufeng until death.

48:10.990 --> 48:13.250
It's solely used on assassins of Wufeng.

48:14.920 --> 48:15.980
After drinking it,

48:17.180 --> 48:19.580
Bone-Gnawing Flies will live in your body.

48:20.780 --> 48:22.530
Usually, you won't feel them.

48:23.340 --> 48:25.140
But you need to take the antidote

48:26.820 --> 48:28.200
every half a month.

48:32.170 --> 48:33.900
I don't know when I can come back

48:34.190 --> 48:36.190
after entering the Gong Residence.

48:36.580 --> 48:38.700
Shouldn't you give me more antidote

48:38.820 --> 48:39.710
to Death Oath?

48:43.930 --> 48:44.990
Every half a month,

48:45.630 --> 48:47.780
someone from Wufeng will meet you

48:48.060 --> 48:49.720
in the town in Jiuchen Valley.

48:49.950 --> 48:51.540
If you have something to offer,

48:51.540 --> 48:53.200
you'll be given the antidote.

48:53.390 --> 48:54.990
No need to finish your words.

48:55.860 --> 48:57.790
I can definitely get the antidote.

48:57.950 --> 48:58.680
Don't worry.

49:01.300 --> 49:02.230
Besides,

49:03.310 --> 49:04.770
from a Chi to a Mei,

49:06.100 --> 49:08.480
I suffered more than one can imagine.

49:11.680 --> 49:13.500
I'm not afraid

49:14.750 --> 49:16.250
of those flies and bugs.

49:18.170 --> 49:20.230
No matter how painful the torture is,

49:21.510 --> 49:22.520
I can bear it.

49:25.230 --> 49:26.140
You can't.

49:30.240 --> 49:30.980
Trust me.

49:36.240 --> 49:37.240
You can't bear it.

49:40.590 --> 49:41.130
So,

49:41.870 --> 49:42.470
you must

49:42.470 --> 49:44.200
get important information

49:45.370 --> 49:47.370
before Fortnight Flies attack you.

49:48.610 --> 49:49.270
You can also

49:50.230 --> 49:52.830
do something that Wufeng deems satisfactory.

49:58.650 --> 49:59.380
Yun Weishan.

50:00.020 --> 50:01.150
Where are you going?

50:03.400 --> 50:05.460
I'm going to send out the information

50:05.850 --> 50:06.590
I gathered.

50:07.990 --> 50:09.070
How?

50:09.970 --> 50:11.970
I'll float lanterns down the river.

50:19.800 --> 50:20.310
Wait.

50:22.500 --> 50:23.430
River lanterns?

50:25.310 --> 50:26.960
In the broad daylight?

50:29.080 --> 50:29.710
Jin Fan.

50:30.260 --> 50:32.530
Get the lanterns out and search upstream.

50:32.530 --> 50:34.590
If you can't find anyone, come downstream to meet me.

50:34.590 --> 50:35.320
Downstream?

50:35.910 --> 50:37.570
Why are you going downstream?

50:48.000 --> 50:48.550
Miss.

50:49.480 --> 50:50.020
Miss.

50:51.080 --> 50:52.080
Miss Yun Weishan.

50:53.260 --> 50:54.260
Miss Yun Weishan.

51:29.200 --> 51:30.080
Yuan Weishan.

51:30.720 --> 51:31.850
It's really you.

51:40.150 --> 51:41.950
Instead of staying in your room,

51:41.990 --> 51:43.500
you're headed to the gate.

51:44.470 --> 51:45.800
What are you going to do?

51:46.870 --> 51:47.730
I want to leave.

51:51.030 --> 51:52.950
You tried to escape

51:53.260 --> 51:55.590
when I first brought you out of the prison.

51:56.440 --> 51:58.320
I thought you ran away

51:58.350 --> 52:00.010
just because you were scared.

52:01.020 --> 52:02.790
Now the assassin has been found.

52:02.790 --> 52:03.990
The dust has settled.

52:04.640 --> 52:06.170
But you still want to leave.

52:06.240 --> 52:07.050
Why?

52:09.550 --> 52:12.010
I never wanted to marry into the Gong family.

52:12.200 --> 52:13.860
Mother forced me to come here.

52:29.240 --> 52:30.170
Don't let her go.

52:31.390 --> 52:32.250
Sword Wielder.

52:32.300 --> 52:34.500
There are words written on the lantern.

52:41.810 --> 52:42.540
Yun Weishan.

52:43.550 --> 52:45.400
You wrote so many words on the lantern

52:45.400 --> 52:47.210
and floated it down the river.

52:47.390 --> 52:48.380
Did you plan

52:48.800 --> 52:50.000
to send messages out?

53:03.990 --> 53:05.990
I'll float lanterns down the river.

53:06.860 --> 53:08.920
Do you take the Gong family for fools?

53:09.650 --> 53:11.550
How to make sure the lanterns end in the right hands?

53:11.550 --> 53:12.990
If they're picked up halfway,

53:12.990 --> 53:15.050
the information on them will be seen.

53:15.870 --> 53:16.260
Yes.

53:17.650 --> 53:19.060
That's my plan.

53:22.210 --> 53:23.720
You didn't drink my tea.

53:24.790 --> 53:26.300
Why are you out of your mind

53:26.950 --> 53:28.090
like Miss Jiang?

53:28.790 --> 53:30.070
I mean,

53:32.600 --> 53:33.730
I'll expose myself.

53:36.150 --> 53:37.810
You were taught to do that too.

53:42.270 --> 53:43.020
I see.

53:43.810 --> 53:46.540
When we're faced with a crisis that may expose us,

53:46.580 --> 53:49.510
we leak insignificant information as a distraction

53:49.870 --> 53:52.620
to hide our true goals and identities.

53:53.030 --> 53:53.680
Yes.

53:54.920 --> 53:56.960
The Gong family is smart,

53:57.990 --> 54:00.360
but everyone will fall for that trick.

54:00.590 --> 54:03.320
Just like Miss Zheng exposed herself willingly.

54:03.700 --> 54:05.360
Once the Gong family believes

54:05.870 --> 54:08.060
that the assassin has been found,

54:08.670 --> 54:10.050
the true assassins,

54:10.270 --> 54:11.050
you and I,

54:11.510 --> 54:12.450
will be safe.

54:16.270 --> 54:17.010
Maybe Miss Zheng

54:17.010 --> 54:18.940
didn't expose herself willingly.

54:20.990 --> 54:22.360
For Wufeng,

54:23.550 --> 54:24.440
her death

54:25.780 --> 54:27.880
is just part of their plan.

54:29.310 --> 54:30.870
The death of every one of us

54:31.510 --> 54:34.320
is just a willing sacrifice they want.

54:36.030 --> 54:38.630
What if Zheng Nanyi was so selfless

54:39.290 --> 54:41.290
and sacrificed herself willingly?

54:44.280 --> 54:45.470
The mountain is steep.

54:45.470 --> 54:46.600
The river runs fast.

54:47.230 --> 54:48.870
Come back as soon as you're done.

54:48.870 --> 54:49.410
No.

54:51.390 --> 54:52.690
I'll go downstream.

54:57.150 --> 54:57.910
I see.

54:58.750 --> 55:01.800
Your target has always been the Sword Wielder

55:02.470 --> 55:03.800
instead of Gong Huanyu.

55:04.190 --> 55:05.350
Now,

55:05.350 --> 55:06.990
the Sword Wielder of the Gong family

55:06.990 --> 55:08.850
has become Gong Ziyu.

55:12.070 --> 55:14.740
Gong Ziyu seems to be a toff,

55:16.450 --> 55:18.640
but judging from what I observed,

55:19.630 --> 55:21.780
he's smarter than he appears.

55:22.470 --> 55:24.950
He'll follow the clue of Miss Jiang's poisoning

55:24.950 --> 55:26.550
to look into the other girls,

55:26.710 --> 55:29.400
especially me who was poisoned too.

55:31.150 --> 55:32.240
To come here,

55:33.110 --> 55:35.170
he'll have to walk up along the river.

55:37.630 --> 55:39.560
I want him to think that our meeting

55:40.670 --> 55:41.790
is by accident.

55:43.600 --> 55:45.800
You want him to think that he's destined

55:45.910 --> 55:47.300
to meet you, right?

55:51.190 --> 55:52.210
You're so smart.

55:52.910 --> 55:54.310
Why are you just a Chi?

55:57.570 --> 55:59.550
But all the information I have

56:00.510 --> 56:03.510
is about his brother's personality and preferences.

56:05.510 --> 56:06.870
This is the information

56:06.870 --> 56:08.470
we collected on Gong Huanyu.

56:11.910 --> 56:12.570
That's all?

56:13.180 --> 56:13.930
That's all.

56:14.370 --> 56:15.370
We tried our best.

56:17.990 --> 56:19.530
Irrelevant information is not included

56:19.530 --> 56:20.570
in it.

56:21.700 --> 56:25.150
For example, Gong Huanyu has a younger brother named Gong Ziyu.

56:25.150 --> 56:26.050
Gong Ziyu?

56:27.470 --> 56:28.990
Do you have his information?

56:28.990 --> 56:30.390
What kind of person is he?

56:31.820 --> 56:32.950
He's not important.

56:33.340 --> 56:35.140
You should focus on Gong Huanyu.

56:36.170 --> 56:38.300
Gong Huanyu is the Young Lord of the Gong family,

56:38.300 --> 56:40.250
which means he's the future Sword Wielder.

56:40.250 --> 56:41.270
Only from him

56:41.860 --> 56:43.260
can you get what you need.

56:45.940 --> 56:46.950
I know very little

56:47.470 --> 56:48.880
about Gong Ziyu.

56:51.550 --> 56:53.810
Gong Ziyu lost his mother at an early age.

56:53.990 --> 56:55.430
That's why he became

56:55.870 --> 56:56.870
a grumpy playboy.

56:57.990 --> 57:01.270
After he grew up, he spent all his time drinking and fooling around.

57:01.270 --> 57:02.600
He can't amount to much.

57:02.750 --> 57:05.770
Gong Ziyu and his father were not close.

57:06.810 --> 57:07.640
Seems that he's never

57:07.640 --> 57:09.370
gotten his father's approval.

57:09.630 --> 57:12.730
His father gave almost all his love

57:13.150 --> 57:14.940
to Gong Huanyu

57:14.970 --> 57:17.430
who was cleverer and better at martial arts.

57:18.310 --> 57:19.070
Father.

57:19.720 --> 57:20.850
I'm cold.

57:21.540 --> 57:22.600
You're so delicate.

57:22.600 --> 57:24.260
You don't deserve to be my son.

57:24.920 --> 57:26.120
Look at your brother.

57:26.280 --> 57:28.210
See how he practices martial arts.

57:33.560 --> 57:36.860
That's why Gong Ziyu gave up on himself.

57:37.900 --> 57:38.480
However,

57:38.980 --> 57:41.670
Gong Huanyu doted on him.

57:43.510 --> 57:45.840
I know what to write on the river lanterns.

57:48.670 --> 57:50.270
Is this river lantern yours?

57:51.650 --> 57:52.110
Yes.

57:54.890 --> 57:56.350
Miss Yun, you're so smart.

57:57.660 --> 57:59.750
You know that if someone discovers the lantern,

57:59.750 --> 58:01.300
they'll go upstream

58:01.900 --> 58:03.630
to find the person who floated it.

58:03.630 --> 58:05.490
So you went downstream on purpose

58:05.510 --> 58:07.040
and took a detour to go back.

58:07.980 --> 58:09.360
But do you know how many guards

58:09.360 --> 58:10.990
there are along the river?

58:11.150 --> 58:11.920
You may…

58:11.940 --> 58:12.790
You get me wrong.

58:12.790 --> 58:14.250
I just want to leave.

58:21.250 --> 58:22.310
Young Master Ziyu.

58:23.460 --> 58:24.220
I beg you.

58:26.480 --> 58:27.410
Please let me go.

58:28.470 --> 58:29.730
There have been rumors

58:29.930 --> 58:31.130
in the Gong Residence

58:31.870 --> 58:33.870
that Gong Ziyu is not a Gong.

58:34.960 --> 58:36.300
His mother, Lady Lan,

58:36.670 --> 58:38.140
had someone she loved

58:39.110 --> 58:41.240
before marrying into the Gong family.

58:41.340 --> 58:42.870
She missed him day and night

58:42.950 --> 58:44.710
and kept trying to escape.

58:45.630 --> 58:47.690
In the end, she died from depression.

58:58.550 --> 58:59.210
Father,

59:00.690 --> 59:02.100
I've got married.

59:03.630 --> 59:05.690
They gave me a lot of betrothal gifts.

59:06.280 --> 59:07.340
I think

59:08.240 --> 59:10.740
Mother doesn't have to work so hard

59:11.110 --> 59:12.840
to support our family anymore.

59:14.270 --> 59:14.830
Father,

59:15.900 --> 59:17.560
I know you've been feeling bad

59:18.720 --> 59:21.180
about not having a son to ennoble our family.

59:22.270 --> 59:23.510
You always said

59:24.090 --> 59:25.650
that I must marry a good man

59:26.550 --> 59:28.230
to show everyone in the town

59:28.990 --> 59:31.390
that the Yun family's daughter is blessed.

59:34.260 --> 59:35.010
But Father,

59:36.280 --> 59:38.340
I wasn't chosen by the Sword Wielder.

59:39.750 --> 59:41.370
Sorry to disappoint you.

59:43.220 --> 59:44.950
Is this really for your father?

59:53.550 --> 59:54.450
Let her go.

59:59.440 --> 01:00:01.170
No matter what your mission is,

01:00:01.620 --> 01:00:03.620
if you want to leave this courtyard,

01:00:03.800 --> 01:00:06.300
you must carefully avoid the guards' patrol route.

01:00:06.300 --> 01:00:07.870
I can draw it for you.

01:00:10.740 --> 01:00:13.500
Don't take the road on the east side.

01:00:14.730 --> 01:00:15.600
Yun Weishan.

01:00:16.150 --> 01:00:17.840
God help you if you lied to me.
